# ── Spread v3 (active production model) ───────────────────────────────────────
# Only the int8 ONNX (9.5 MB) and metadata are committed; the full-precision
# model.onnx (30 MB) and training checkpoint model.pt (30 MB) are excluded.
# NOTE: exclude patterns must come AFTER the include-all /** rule to take precedence.
!models/spread_v3/
models/spread_v3/*
!models/spread_v3/20260308_151315_fe0e5f16d7f0f59da935a7e63d1f64ee624f6f55/
